<title>GREECE: HARAMIS, COX BROKERS' KONDYLAS GOES TO ABN-AMRO BANK.</title>
<headline>HARAMIS, COX BROKERS' KONDYLAS GOES TO ABN-AMRO BANK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael Kondylas, formerly with Haramis, Cox brokers, will join the spot foreign exchange dealing team of ABN-AMRO Bank headed by John Kokkinias, market sources told Reuters.</p>
<p>Kondylas will assume his new duties on March 3, they said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
